torv: A flooded pit and they're sat on the rim of it. Three benches up, and every one's a ledge — mind who's standing next to the drop, ours and theirs.
torv: The banks are the long way. If someone can freeze us a bridge to that pier, that's the short way — and it's their short way down, too. Melt it behind you.
torv: That grass up top will burn. Whoever's holding a fire rune up there won't care. We will.
